			<Text>Trade Route Capacity ({1_current}/{2_total})</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_CAPACITY_TOOLTIP">
			<Text>You do not have enough Trade Route Capacity to send another Trade Route to this player. Enact the Improve Trade Relations Endeavor with this player to increase Trade Route Capacity.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_CAPACITY_INAPPLICABLE_TOOLTIP">
			<Text>Although you would not ordinarily have enough Trade Route Capacity to send another Trade Route to this player, your civilization allows you to trade with them regardless.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_IN_RANGE">
			<Text>In Range</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_IN_RANGE_TOOLTIP">
			<Text>This Settlement is too far from any of your Settlements to establish a Trade Route. Increase your Trade Range via policies, tech, or other measures or found a new Settlement closer.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_AT_PEACE">
			<Text>At Peace</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_AT_PEACE_TOOLTIP">
			<Text>You are [STYLE:text-negative]AT WAR[/S] with this player! Make peace if you wish to trade with this player.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_COMMERCE_TRADE_STATUS_AT_PEACE_INAPPLICABLE_TOOLTIP">
			<Text>Although you are at War with this player, your Civilization doesn't require peace to trade.</Text>
		</Row>
